Library, and the process is then not an Eligible Compilation Process.

  "Target Code" is the output of an Eligible Compilation Process, in one
file or several, in machine code, intermediate language or both.

  The "Options File" is the file protoc/include/fletcher/options.proto
in Fletcher, which the package Eiva.Fletcher.Protoc also carries.

  The "Generator" is protoc-gen-fletcher, the protoc plugin built from
